IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEDGER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE PIC 9(7).
01 AMOUNT PIC 9(7).
01 TYPE PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER OPENING BALANCE:"
    ACCEPT BALANCE

    DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION TYPE (C/D):"
    ACCEPT TYPE

    DISPLAY "ENTER AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT

    IF TYPE = 'C'
        ADD AMOUNT TO BALANCE
        DISPLAY "CREDIT SUCCESS"
    ELSE
        IF TYPE = 'D'
            IF AMOUNT <= BALANCE
                SUBTRACT AMOUNT FROM BALANCE
                DISPLAY "DEBIT SUCCESS"
            ELSE
                DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT BALANCE"
            END-IF
        ELSE
            DISPLAY "INVALID TYPE"
        END-IF
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "FINAL BALANCE: " BALANCE

    STOP RUN.
